<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 12.3 points to 856.2 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 12.3 points to 856.2 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 12.3 points on Thursday to 856.2, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the construction index falling the most, down 22.6 points, or 2.31 percent, to 957.3 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
